    "description": "This circular walk explores the area around Danebridge. The route explores the lovely River Dane Valley using a section of the Dane Valley Way long distance trail. There's nice riverside paths, country trails and a visit to Forest Wood at the eastern end of the walk. The route also passes the wonderful cavern of Lud's Church which is well worth exploring.",
